{"availability":"available","full":"Anamikaprakash26/stock-ledger","name":"stock-ledger","description":"Inventory & stock-movement tracker — derived on-hand balances, loss tracking, filters. Next.js 15 + Prisma. Clean-room engineering demo.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-17T02:44:08Z","updated":"2026-07-17T03:03:54Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stock-ledger-anamikaprakash26s-projects.vercel.app","topics":["inventory","nextjs","prisma","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://stock-ledger-anamikaprakash26s-projects.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:55.721Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:55.721Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:55.721Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:30.267Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:11:33.281Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:55.721Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An inventory & stock-movement tracker — where stock is, and where it's being lost.","Record purchases, transfers between locations, and losses; the app derives on-hand balances live from the movement ledger and surfaces where stock is disappearing. Built to make a physical goods operation visible: what came in, what's where, and what leaked out.","This is a clean-room build — an independent, generic reimplementation of the kind of inventory system I helped build for a real trading business, rebuilt from scratch with a made-up domain (warehouse goods) and entirely synthetic data. It contains no company code or data."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anamikaprakash26/stock-ledger/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc53fb80da3e70d819d2e4e18065a50efc0cd8b415e0a9621475e1011d04e71c","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:30.397Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:30.397Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An inventory & stock-movement tra